  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0037, merged in PR #4181): all resolution surfaces are derived in a single finalization pass from one verdict, eliminating the disjoint-producer-sets root cause behind the 67.8% null dst_ref on unresolved edges. Waits on the finalization implementation."  # fa41
