- op: discuss  # 4ea7
  at: '2026-06-17T01:52:04Z'  # 4ea7
  by: agent  # 4ea7
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 4ea7
  clock: 5  # 4ea7
  nonce: 4ea7  # 4ea7
  message: "Closed by ADR-0037 ruling 2 (PR merged selfh/dev 2dd851297d). make_unresolved_edge now derives dst_ref from (lang, module_hint, callee_name), and the finalizer backstop _derive_dst_ref_from_id reconstructs it from the dst id for any bypassing producer. BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE — live re-probe on packages/hypergumbo-core/src: dst_ref coverage on is_resolved=False edges WITH A REAL MODULE PATH = 19% -> 100% (1996/1996). The remaining sentinel-'external' edges correctly stay dst_ref=None (WI-huzuv: the ADR-0037 'unidentified reference' cell — never fabricate module_path='external'), which is why the all-edges figure is 41%, not 100%. Full suite 19061 passed, 100% cov."  # 4ea7
